ction won’t rise up the second time."},{"verse":10,"text":"For entangled like thorns, and drunken as with their drink, they are consumed utterly like dry stubble."},{"verse":11,"text":"One has gone out of you who devises evil against the LORD, who counsels wickedness."},{"verse":12,"text":"The LORD says: “Though they are in full strength and likewise many, even so they will be cut down and pass away. Though I have afflicted you, I will afflict you no more."},{"verse":13,"text":"Now I will break his yoke from off you, and will burst your bonds apart.”"},{"verse":14,"text":"The LORD has commanded concerning you: “No more descendants will bear your name. Out of the house of your gods, I will cut off the engraved image and the molten image. I will make your grave, for you are vile.”"},{"verse":15,"text":"Behold, on the mountains the feet of him who brings good news, who publishes peace! Keep your feasts, Judah! Perform your vows, for the wicked one will no more pass through you. He is utterly cut off."}],"hasArtwork":true,"artworkUrl":"/data/images/books/nahum.svg","availableLangs":["zh-CN"]},{"id":"nahum_2","bookSlug":"nahum","chapter":2,"reference":"Nahum 2","title":"Nahum 2 — Public Domain Study","topics":["nahum","nahum","ot","scripture","那鴻書","那鸿书","尼尼微的傾覆","尼尼微的倾覆"],"snippet":{"zh-CN":"尼尼微啊，那打碎邦国的上来攻击你。 你要看守保障，谨防道路， 使腰强壮，大大勉力。 （"},"tokens":{"13":2,"34":1,"nahum":9,"public":2,"domain":2,"study":1,"ot":1,"scripture":1,"那鴻書":1,"那鸿书":2,"尼尼微的傾覆":1,"尼尼微的倾覆":1,"尼尼微啊":1,"那打碎邦国的上来攻击你":1,"你要看守保障":1,"谨防道路":1,"使腰强壮":1,"大大勉力":1,"耶和华复兴雅各的荣华":1,"好像以色列的荣华一样":1,"因为使地空虚的":1,"已经使雅各和以色列空虚":1,"将他们的葡萄枝毁坏了":1,"他勇士的盾牌是红的":1,"精兵都穿朱红衣服":1,"在他预备争战的日子":1,"战车上的钢铁闪烁如火":1,"柏木把的枪也抡起来了":1,"车辆在街上":1,"急行":2,"在宽阔处奔来奔去":1,"形状如火把":1,"飞跑如闪电":1,"尼尼微王招聚他的贵胄":1,"他们步行绊跌":1,"速上城墙":1,"预备挡牌":1,"河闸开放":1,"宫殿冲没":1,"王后蒙羞":1,"被人掳去":1,"宫女捶胸":1,"哀鸣如鸽":1,"此乃命定之事":1,"尼尼微自古以来充满人民":1,"如同聚水的池子":1,"现在居民却都逃跑":1,"虽有人呼喊说":1,"站住":4,"却无人回顾":1,"你们抢掠金银吧":1,"因为所积蓄的无穷":1,"华美的宝器无数":1,"尼尼微现在空虚荒凉":1,"人心消化":1,"双膝相碰":1,"腰都疼痛":1,"脸都变色":